# demo.bin is the compiled output of compile_image.sh (stock firmware + patched
# kernel).  It is intentionally excluded from version control because it is a
# large binary that is generated locally by the end-user.  generate_checksum.sh
# also skips demo.bin when building file.chk.
demo.bin
demo*.zip

# NOTE: v2_kernel.bin IS intentionally committed to this directory.  It is the
# pre-built replacement kernel binary for the Wyze Cam v2 / Pan v1.  Committing
# it means contributors do not need a cross-compilation toolchain just to run
# compile_image.sh.
